        {
          "id": "7519b79b-5be2-3318-b7a2-4cadbd40cdbf",
          "content": {
            "id": "7519b79b-5be2-3318-b7a2-4cadbd40cdbf",
            "contentType": "STORY",
            "title": "Did US$35.6 Million in Federal Support Just Shift Trilogy Metals' (TSX:TMQ) Investment Narrative?",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "Earlier in 2025, Trilogy Metals outlined its 2026 program and budget for Ambler Metals LLC, alongside a US$35.6 million US federal investment to advance permitting, technical de-risking, and long-term development at the Upper Kobuk Mineral Projects in Alaska. This combination of a detailed multi-year work plan and direct federal funding support underscores growing institutional backing for Trilogy\u2019s Arctic and Bornite projects as they move toward mine permit submissions targeted for...",
            "pubDate": "2025-12-19T18:06:48Z",
            "displayTime": "2025-12-19T18:06:48Z",
            "isHosted": true,
            "bypassModal": false,
